{"id":"e6a4271733f0e0d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md","title":"Weil Conjectures","display":"df-weil-conjectures — Weil Conjectures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weil-conjectures","aliases":["58-df-weil-conjectures"],"display":"df-weil-conjectures — Weil Conjectures","depends_on":["[[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weil-conjectures"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weil-conjectures</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weil-conjectures — Weil Conjectures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e85b3308cfc79da5\" href=\"?note=e85b3308cfc79da5\" title=\"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety\">58-df-finite-field-projective-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (a presented smooth projective variety over the designated finite field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F_q\">\\(\\mathbb F_q\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e85b3308cfc79da5\" href=\"?note=e85b3308cfc79da5\" title=\"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety\">58-df-finite-field-projective-variety</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_X(t)\">\\(Z_X(t)\\)</span> (zeta function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)\">\\(P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i=\\deg P_i\">\\(b_i=\\deg P_i\\)</span> (Frobenius characteristic polynomials)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^i b_i\">\\(\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^i b_i\\)</span> (Euler characteristic)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeilConj}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeilConj}_S\\)</span> (Weil conjectures predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\to Z_X(t)\\coloneqq\\exp\\!\\left(\\sum_{m\\ge1}\\frac{|X(\\mathbb F_{q^m})|}{m}t^m\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\to Z_X(t)\\coloneqq\\exp\\!\\left(\\sum_{m\\ge1}\\frac{|X(\\mathbb F_{q^m})|}{m}t^m\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}conjectures} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeilConj}_S(X,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\land\\exists\\vec P,\\vec b,\\vec\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\vec P=\\langle P_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec b=\\langle b_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec\\alpha=\\left\\langle\\langle\\alpha_{ij}:1\\le j\\le b_i\\rangle:i\\le2d\\right\\rangle\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\bigl(P_i\\in\\mathbb Z[t]\\land P_i(0)=1\\land b_i=\\deg P_i\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land Z_X(t)=\\prod_{i=0}^{2d}P_i(t)^{(-1)^{i+1}}\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\left(P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,b_i\\}\\;(\\alpha_{ij}\\in\\mathbb C\\land|\\alpha_{ij}|=q^{i/2})\\right)\\Bigr)\\land\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^ib_i\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\left(Z_X\\!\\left(\\frac1{q^dt}\\right)=\\varepsilon q^{d\\chi(X)/2}t^{\\chi(X)}Z_X(t)\\right)\\Biggr]\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}conjectures} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeilConj}_S(X,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\land\\exists\\vec P,\\vec b,\\vec\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\vec P=\\langle P_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec b=\\langle b_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec\\alpha=\\left\\langle\\langle\\alpha_{ij}:1\\le j\\le b_i\\rangle:i\\le2d\\right\\rangle\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\bigl(P_i\\in\\mathbb Z[t]\\land P_i(0)=1\\land b_i=\\deg P_i\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land Z_X(t)=\\prod_{i=0}^{2d}P_i(t)^{(-1)^{i+1}}\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\left(P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,b_i\\}\\;(\\alpha_{ij}\\in\\mathbb C\\land|\\alpha_{ij}|=q^{i/2})\\right)\\Bigr)\\land\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^ib_i\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\left(Z_X\\!\\left(\\frac1{q^dt}\\right)=\\varepsilon q^{d\\chi(X)/2}t^{\\chi(X)}Z_X(t)\\right)\\Biggr]\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weil proved the curve case; Dwork proved rationality in general.</li>\n<li>The cohomological formalism supplies rationality and the functional equation, while Deligne proved the Riemann-hypothesis weight bound.</li>\n<li>The normalizations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0=1-t\">\\(P_0=1-t\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{2d}=1-q^dt\">\\(P_{2d}=1-q^dt\\)</span> require geometric connectedness; they are not imposed by this general smooth-projective predicate.</li>\n<li>Étale cohomology replaces singular cohomology over finite fields.</li>\n<li>Lefschetz fixed point formula: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#X(\\mathbb{F}_q) = \\sum (-1)^i \\mathrm{tr}(F, H^i)\">\\(\\#X(\\mathbb{F}_q) = \\sum (-1)^i \\mathrm{tr}(F, H^i)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety","status":"resolved","id":"e85b3308cfc79da5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety","status":"resolved","id":"e85b3308cfc79da5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)$ (see [[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)","display":false},{"tex":"Z_X(t)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)","display":false},{"tex":"b_i=\\deg P_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^i b_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeilConj}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\to Z_X(t)\\coloneqq\\exp\\!\\left(\\sum_{m\\ge1}\\frac{|X(\\mathbb F_{q^m})|}{m}t^m\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}conjectures} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeilConj}_S(X,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)\\land\\exists\\vec P,\\vec b,\\vec\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\vec P=\\langle P_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec b=\\langle b_i:i\\le2d\\rangle\\land\\vec\\alpha=\\left\\langle\\langle\\alpha_{ij}:1\\le j\\le b_i\\rangle:i\\le2d\\right\\rangle\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\bigl(P_i\\in\\mathbb Z[t]\\land P_i(0)=1\\land b_i=\\deg P_i\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land Z_X(t)=\\prod_{i=0}^{2d}P_i(t)^{(-1)^{i+1}}\\land\\Bigl(\\forall i\\le2d\\;\\left(P_i(t)=\\prod_{j=1}^{b_i}(1-\\alpha_{ij}t)\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,b_i\\}\\;(\\alpha_{ij}\\in\\mathbb C\\land|\\alpha_{ij}|=q^{i/2})\\right)\\Bigr)\\land\\chi(X)=\\sum_{i=0}^{2d}(-1)^ib_i\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\left(Z_X\\!\\left(\\frac1{q^dt}\\right)=\\varepsilon q^{d\\chi(X)/2}t^{\\chi(X)}Z_X(t)\\right)\\Biggr]\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"P_0=1-t","display":false},{"tex":"P_{2d}=1-q^dt","display":false},{"tex":"\\#X(\\mathbb{F}_q) = \\sum (-1)^i \\mathrm{tr}(F, H^i)","display":false}],"bytes":2402,"backlinks":[{"id":"5edfa66c6abe1ecc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1384","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md|58-df-weil-conjectures]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["e85b3308cfc79da5"]}